[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-STD001
TITLE: TOML accept and reject cases
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall load config/n123ab.toml and expect N123AB, runway 27, and the full-stop option. It shall then reject an empty file, a file missing the registration, a pattern value of sideways, a frequency of 100.0, and a missing file. Acceptance is those results and no aircraft object for the rejected files. The test file is apps/aircraft/tests/test_config.py.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is the example test for the configuration requirement.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this record does not claim certification authority approval.
